sequenceDiagram
    participant TradingCore as "Trading Core"
    participant EventBus as "Event Bus"
    participant ReportingSvc as "Reporting Service"
    participant ProjectionStore as "Reporting Store"
    participant Analyst as "Commercial Analyst"
    participant Dashboard as "Reporting Dashboard"
    participant AuditStore as "Audit Store"

    TradingCore->>EventBus: Publish accepted, filled, and balance events
    EventBus->>ReportingSvc: Deliver lifecycle events
    ReportingSvc->>ProjectionStore: Update reporting projections
    ProjectionStore-->>ReportingSvc: Projection write complete

    Analyst->>Dashboard: Request trading activity insight
    Dashboard->>ReportingSvc: Query metrics by period and instrument
    ReportingSvc->>ProjectionStore: Read reporting projections
    ProjectionStore-->>ReportingSvc: Return aggregated metrics
    ReportingSvc-->>Dashboard: Show business insights

    opt Trade dispute investigation
        Analyst->>Dashboard: Open trade lifecycle detail
        Dashboard->>ReportingSvc: Request end to end trade trace
        ReportingSvc->>AuditStore: Load immutable audit trail
        AuditStore-->>ReportingSvc: Return accepted, priced, and settled events
        ReportingSvc-->>Dashboard: Show reconstructable trade history
    end
